{
  "_readme": "Voice casting for the recorded voice pack. For ElevenLabs, 'elevenlabs' can be a voice name from your ElevenLabs account (e.g. \"George\") or a voice ID; leave it empty and tools/cast-voices.mjs picks one using 'want'. 'settings' are ElevenLabs voice settings (lower stability = more expressive). 'direction' is used by OpenAI only. 'heroVoices' lists the hero voices to record: 2 halves the pack; the game shares recordings between similar hero voices. 'want.avoid' lists traits to steer away from when auto-casting.",
